<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>API Docs - URL Shortener</title>
		<link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
		<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
	</head>
	<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased">
		<%- include('partials/header'); -%>

		<main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
			<header class="max-w-3xl">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400">Developer reference</p>
				<h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">URL Shortener API</h1>
				<p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">Create short links programmatically and read click analytics with the JSON API.</p>
				<div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-sm text-slate-300">
					<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
					Base URL: <span class="text-cyan-300">/api/url</span>
				</div>
			</header>

			<section class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
				<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 shadow-xl shadow-slate-950/20">
					<div class="border-b border-slate-800 p-6">
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
							<span class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-400/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase text-emerald-300">POST</span>
							<code class="text-lg text-white">/register</code>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">Create a short URL from a destination URL.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="space-y-5 p-6">
						<div>
							<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">Request body</h2>
							<pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-cyan-200"><code>{
	"url": "https://example.com/article"
}</code></pre>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">Response</h2>
							<pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-cyan-200"><code>{
	"message": "success",
	"data": {
		"shortedURL": "http://localhost:8000/1"
	}
}</code></pre>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">Example</h2>
							<pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-200"><code>curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/url/register \
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
	-d '{"url":"https://example.com/article"}'</code></pre>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/70 shadow-xl shadow-slate-950/20">
					<div class="border-b border-slate-800 p-6">
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
							<span class="rounded-lg bg-sky-400/15 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase text-sky-300">GET</span>
							<code class="text-lg text-white">/:urlId/stats</code>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">Retrieve analytics for a shortened URL.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="space-y-5 p-6">
						<div>
							<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">Query parameters</h2>
							<dl class="mt-3 divide-y divide-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 px-4">
								<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="font-mono text-sm text-cyan-300">type</dt><dd class="text-right text-sm text-slate-400">line, os, or country. Defaults to line.</dd></div>
								<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="font-mono text-sm text-cyan-300">from</dt><dd class="text-right text-sm text-slate-400">Accepted by the API, reserved for date filtering.</dd></div>
							</dl>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">Response examples</h2>
							<pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-cyan-200"><code>GET /api/url/1/stats?type=line

{
	"message": "success",
	"type": "line",
	"data": [{ "x": "2026-08-26", "y": 12 }]
}</code></pre>
							<pre class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-cyan-200"><code>?type=os   -> [{ "os": "Linux", "count": 8 }]
?type=country -> [{ "country": "United States", "count": 5 }]</code></pre>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>
			</section>

			<p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-500">All API responses are JSON. Replace <code class="text-slate-300">localhost:8000</code> with your deployed host.</p>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
